Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 09:05:26 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] MAP R6.1: Agent List TLV Implementation

After successful onboarding of a new Multi-AP Agent
using 1905 PBC method, the Multi-AP Controller shall
send to the newly onboarded Enrollee Multi-AP Agent
and all the other existing Multi-AP Agents an
Agent List message including the Agent List TLV with
the list of all the Multi-AP Agents that are part of
the Multi-AP network (including the newly enrolled
Multi-AP Agent itself).

Signed-off-by: Sonali Naresh <sonanare@qti.qualcomm.com>
---
 controller/src/beerocks/master/controller.cpp | 12 +++
 .../src/beerocks/master/son_actions.cpp       | 84 +++++++++++++++++++
 controller/src/beerocks/master/son_actions.h  | 19 +++++
 .../beerocks/master/tasks/topology_task.cpp   | 21 +++++
 4 files changed, 136 insertions(+)

